stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Incoming: Insert Request
    
    Incoming --> Validating: Validate
    Validating --> Rejected: Invalid
    Rejected --> [*]
    
    Validating --> InWAL: Valid
    InWAL --> InMemtable: Write to Memtable
    
    InMemtable --> Indexed: Update Index
    Indexed --> Searchable: Available for Search
    
    Searchable --> Cached: Frequently Accessed
    Searchable --> Flushing: Flush Threshold
    Cached --> Searchable: Cache Eviction
    
    Flushing --> InSSTable: SST Engine
    Flushing --> InParquet: VIPER Engine
    
    InSSTable --> Compressed: Apply Compression
    InParquet --> Compressed: Apply Compression
    
    Compressed --> OnDisk: Write to Disk
    OnDisk --> Tiered: Move to Slower Tier
    
    Tiered --> ColdStorage: Archive
    ColdStorage --> Retrieved: Access Request
    Retrieved --> OnDisk: Restore
    
    OnDisk --> Compacting: Compaction
    Compacting --> Optimized: Merge Complete
    Optimized --> OnDisk: Write Back
    
    Searchable --> Updating: Update Request
    Updating --> InWAL: New Version
    
    Searchable --> Deleting: Delete Request
    Deleting --> Tombstoned: Mark Deleted
    Tombstoned --> Purged: Compaction
    Purged --> [*]
    
    note right of InWAL: Durability guaranteed
    note right of InMemtable: Fast access
    note right of Indexed: Search optimized
    note right of Cached: Hot data in memory
    note right of OnDisk: Persistent storage
    note right of ColdStorage: Cost-optimized
    note right of Tombstoned: Logical deletion
    
    classDef active fill:#E8F4F8,stroke:#2E86AB,stroke-width:2px
    classDef storage fill:#FFF5FA,stroke:#A23B72,stroke-width:2px
    classDef processing fill:#FFF8E7,stroke:#F18F01,stroke-width:2px
    classDef cached fill:#E7F5E7,stroke:#5C9E7F,stroke-width:2px
    classDef deleted fill:#FFE0E0,stroke:#FF6B6B,stroke-width:2px
    
    class InWAL,InMemtable,Indexed,Searchable active
    class InSSTable,InParquet,OnDisk,Tiered,ColdStorage storage
    class Flushing,Compacting,Updating processing
    class Cached cached
    class Tombstoned,Purged deleted